        <h3>JST (formerly AARTS or SMART) - Marine Corps, Navy, Coast Guard, Army, National Guard, and Army Reserve</h3>
        <p>An official copy of the Joint Services Transcript may be requested online at <span data-field>url_jst</span>. This program is coordinated by the Financial Aid Office.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>Veterans Education Benefits - GI Bill</h2>
        <p>The Department of Veterans Affairs (DVA) makes all determinations of a student's eligibility for education benefits. Individuals applying for GI Bill benefits should allow a minimum of 6-8 weeks after submitting application for benefits and all supporting documents to the DVA before receiving notification of eligibility.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h3>First Time Applicants for Education Benefits (Chapters 30, 33, and 1606)</h3>
        <ol>
            <li>Complete and submit VA Form 22-1990, Application for Educational Benefits online at <span data-field>url_form_221990</span>.</li>
            <li>Complete B/R GI Bill Information page (located on STARS) every semester benefits are to be received.</li>
            <li>Students receiving Chapter 30 (Montgomery GI Bill Active Duty) and Chapter 1606 (Montgomery GI Bill Selected Reserve Program) benefits must verify their enrollment the last day of each month (or after) with the DVA by calling (<span data-field>phone_number</span>) <span data-field>phone_number_suffix</span> or online at <span data-field>url_dva_verify</span>.</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h3>Previous Recipients of Education Benefits (Chapters 30, 33 and 1606)</h3>
        <ol>
            <li>Complete B/R GI Bill Information page (located on STARS) every semester benefits are to be received.</li>
            <li>Students receiving Chapter 30 (Montgomery GI Bill Active Duty) and Chapter 1606 (Montgomery GI Bill Selected Reserve Program) benefits must verify their enrollment the last day of each month (or after) with the DVA by calling (<span data-field>phone_number</span>) <span data-field>phone_number_suffix</span> or online at <span data-field>url_dva_verify</span>.</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h3>Previous Recipients Transferring to or Re-entering Western (Chapters 30, 33 and 1606)</h3>
        <ol>
            <li>Complete and submit VA Form 22-1995, Change of Program/Change in Training online at <span data-field>url_form_221995</span>.</li>
        </ol>
    </div>
</div>

