    <div class="section">
        <h3>Chapter 33 Post-9/11 GI Bill</h3>
        <p>Education benefits may be available to eligible individuals to assist with tuition/fees, books/supplies and housing. To be eligible for the Post-9/11 GI Bill, Chapter 33 program, applicants must have at least 90 days of aggregate service on or after September 11, 2001, or must have been discharged with a service-connected disability after 30 days.</p>
