        <p>Review additional information at <span data-field>url_benefits_va</span>. Department of Veterans Affairs representatives may be consulted to discuss benefit eligibility by telephoning (<span data-field>phone_number</span>) (<span data-field>phone_number_suffix</span>) or (<span data-field>phone_number</span>) (<span data-field>phone_number_suffix</span>).</p>
        <p>To apply for the program for the first time, individuals must complete and submit VA Form 22-1990, Application for Educational Benefits online at <span data-field>url_form_221990_again</span>.</p>
